---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — WoW Forever Talent Calculator"
  description="About this site: an independent, free, no-login WoW Forever talent planning tool — what it does, what it deliberately does not do, and how to report corrections."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'About', url: '/about/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <h1>About This Site</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      WoW Forever Talent Calculator is an independent, fan-made planning tool.
      It is free to use, requires no account, and runs entirely on openly
      licensed, clearly labeled data.
    </p>
    <p class="prose">
      Maintained by the WoW Forever Talent Calculator team — a small fan
      project, built by players for players.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="what-it-does">
    <h2 id="what-it-does">What it does</h2>
    <p>
      The site covers all nine WoW Forever classes with three talent trees
      each. You can spend points under the standard rules (budget, row gates,
      prerequisites), save setups in your browser, share them as links, and
      compare two builds point by point. Reference pages list every talent
      with its rank text, evidence status, and Classic comparison as static,
      citable HTML.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="what-it-does-not">
    <h2 id="what-it-does-not">What it deliberately does not do</h2>
    <p>
      This is a planner, not a simulator: there is no DPS simulation, no gear
      modeling, and no automatic "best build" recommendation. Where the data
      is uncertain, the site says so per rank instead of filling gaps with
      guesses or silently borrowing Classic values.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="data">
    <h2 id="data">Data &amp; attribution</h2>
    <p>
      Talent data comes from
      {' '}<a href="https://talentsforever.com/" rel="external">talentsforever.com</a>
      {' '}(<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="external">
        CC BY 4.0
      </a>), published as immutable snapshots with per-rank evidence
      statuses. The full source list, coverage numbers, and update policy are
      on the <a href="/sources/">Sources</a> page.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="contact">
    <h2 id="contact">Corrections &amp; contact</h2>
    <p>
      Found a wrong rank text, a broken prerequisite, or a stale link?
      Corrections are welcome — open an issue on the project's GitHub
      repository (link to be published here) or email
      {' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@wowforevertalentcalculator.com">
        contact@wowforevertalentcalculator.com
      </a>. Please
      include the snapshot ID shown on the page so the report can be checked
      against the exact data you saw.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="independence">
    <h2 id="independence">Independence notice</h2>
    <p>
      Independent fan-made tool. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard
      Entertainment. Game names and related terms belong to their respective
      owners; this site uses original styling and neutral placeholder icons
      only.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
